Modifications in this repository
--------------------------------
- Added end-to-end Montenegro EFI fiscalization against the CIS: SOAP client,
  XML-DSig signing, IKOF/IIC and JIKR/FIC handling, QR verification, invoice
  types, advances, corrective and storno documents, subsequent delivery, cash
  deposits, TCR/ENU registration, fiscal counters, audit log, and journal
  export.
- Added Montenegro company settings, certificate handling, fiscalization API
  endpoints, admin integration, PDF fiscal block, tests, and documentation.
- Added a Docker Compose stack for local development and deployment (app,
  MySQL, Redis, worker, scheduler, optional backup profile).
- Changed PDF generation behavior and performance: CPU limits, blank-PDF
  detection, configurable Chromium virtual-time budget, optional negative
  caching for image fetches, and skipping the hidden whitelabel image when the
  account is white-labelled.
- Changed the default currency symbol position for EUR and Montenegro so that
  amounts render with the symbol after the value, for example "1.000,00 €".
  See migration 2026_11_09_000001_set_montenegro_currency_symbol_position.php.
- Added bilingual documentation (English and Montenegrin/Serbian).

